use moonlight to spot their prey.

53
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:18,880
Others,

54
00:01:19,180 --> 00:01:19,820
like lions,

55
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:22,040
actually hunt best on the darkest

56
00:01:22,040 --> 00:01:22,560
nights.

57
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,320
So some animals would win,

58
00:01:24,580 --> 00:01:25,840
and others would lose.

59
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:28,180
Whole food chains could shift in

60
00:01:28,180 --> 00:01:28,620
the dark.

61
00:01:29,180 --> 00:01:29,500
Moths,

62
